{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>COLLAR成員Ivy So於11月25日現身商業電台為單曲《葬花辭》宣傳，其大膽貼身造型意外成為全網焦點。原本一件被指極似平價發熱衣上衣，穿在她身上瞬間引發網民瘋狂洗版討論。這位女歌手在受訪時更無預警宣佈一個震撼樂壇重磅消息。</p>\n<h2>蘇雅琳貼身私服現身商台惹騷動</h2>\n<p>昨日Ivy So前往商業電台接受節目訪問，捨棄MV中經典古典裝扮，換上極具現代感剪裁服飾。她戴上金絲眼鏡搭配深棕色小高領五分袖超貼身短版上衣與低腰牛仔褲，大方展露零贅肉纖腰。面對守候多時粉絲瘋狂拍攝，她心情風騷地大派心心及飛吻，在鏡頭前擺出鬼馬表情，展現出知性與性感兼備一面。</p>\n<h2>夥拍謝安琪推合唱版《葬花辭》</h2>\n<p>受訪期間Ivy So大方分享本年度壓軸單曲《葬花辭》背後創作艱辛歷程。她透露首次挑戰以經典名著為題材難度極高，幸得共同填詞人鄭敏提供嶄新角度切入凄美愛情故事。同時她親自宣佈一個重磅消息，昨日已破天荒推出與樂壇天后謝安琪合唱版本，兩代歌手正式在音樂及視覺上聯手展開合作。</p>\n<h2>蘇雅琳單曲獲好評衝擊女歌手獎</h2>\n<p>這首由張繼聰作曲及黃兆銘編曲並由舒文監製作品《葬花辭》，深刻描繪錯愛無果遺憾情感。隨著新歌推出及宣傳攻勢一浪接一浪，她在音樂領域上展現出強大企圖心。近期在音樂作品口碑與網絡流量雙管齊下，她正挾著這股氣勢全力衝擊今年流行榜頒獎典禮個人女歌手獎項。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>「貼身打底衫」成秋冬潮流 網民聯想GU熱賣發熱衣</strong></b></h2>\n<p>隨著天氣轉涼，這類主打親膚、高彈性及修身剪裁的「小高領貼身短版上衣」在今季大行其道，不少時尚達人亦熱衷於將原本作內搭用途的單品直接「打底外穿」，藉此突顯身體線條。</p>\n<p>Ivy的造型曝光後，亦引發不少網民「以圖搜尋」找尋同款。由於上衣設計簡約且帶有微透視質感，不少網民笑言款式與近期在Threads上爆紅、被網民封為「性價比神物」的日系品牌GU極暖系列或透膚高領發熱衣極為相似，指「普通人著係保暖內衣，Ivy著就變高級戰衣」，再度印證其強大的時尚駕馭力。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438475811638_4765167226b07aa013aede.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"928519512_18356056594264426_278098037832718973_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438475811638_4765167226b07aa013aede.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@903music）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438651235711_9612356756b07aa02d437b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"callbibibicollar_1795592707_4038046385739037846_38513618377.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438651235711_9612356756b07aa02d437b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@callbibibicollar）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438795557196_7581503886b07aa0449ee4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"925128895_2783161392145327_3649131774094851454_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438795557196_7581503886b07aa0449ee4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@903music）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438982765798_15600079666b07aa06866bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"callbibibicollar_1795591921_4038039904348050988_38513618377.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179566438982765798_15600079666b07aa06866bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@callbibibicollar）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956643915947196_15596424336b07aa07f368f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"callbibibicollar_1795592707_4038046367653094922_38513618377.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956643915947196_15596424336b07aa07f368f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@callbibibicollar）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.394051+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1139,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:39:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T04:13:48.463030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:05.911769+00:00","content_hash":"73b7a82e6edde62527cb544f13b44f89eccd59709830abda642a0485e3d35e70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}